[2026-03-14T23:17:10.190Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Np1AN1fVGdaKZVvC39yjxs","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile my findings:\n\n## Linear Clone App - Complete Analysis\n\n### 1. App Directory\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone`\n\nThe LinearClone app is a comprehensive issue tracking system with teams, projects, cycles, and workspace management.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Documentation\n**Tests.md**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` (2,685 lines)\n- Comprehensive test specifications covering all pages and components\n- Organized by feature: Login, SignUp, Sidebar, Teams, Members, Issues, Projects, Cycles, etc.\n- Includes expected behavior, initial states, actions, and assertions\n\n---\n\n### 3. Test Files Location\n**Directory**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`\n\nKey team-related test files:\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/team-settings.spec.ts` - Team settings page (inline editing, delete confirmations)\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/team-settings-members.spec.ts` - Team member management (add/remove members)\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/teams-page.spec.ts` - Teams page rendering\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/teams-create.spec.ts` - Create team modal\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/teams-create-advanced.spec.ts` - Advanced team creation\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/sidebar-navigation.spec.ts` - Sidebar team navigation\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/members-list.spec.ts` - Members page list\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/members-invite.spec.ts` - Invite modal\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/members-actions.spec.ts` - Role dropdown, remove actions\n\n---\n\n### 4. Team Settings Components & Pages\n\n#### TeamSettings Component\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamSettings.tsx` (435 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- Inline editable fields: Team name, identifier prefix (2-5 uppercase chars), description\n- Team Members section with add/remove functionality\n- Delete team confirmation dialog\n- State management for editing modes and errors\n- Full persistence via Redux/async thunks\n\nKey testIds:\n- `team-settings`, `team-settings-name-field`, `team-settings-identifier-field`, `team-settings-description-field`\n- `team-settings-members-section`, `team-settings-members-list`, `team-settings-add-member-btn`\n- `team-settings-delete-btn`, `team-settings-delete-confirm`\n\n#### Teams Page\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Teams.tsx` (102 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- List all teams in grid layout\n- Create Team button opens CreateTeamModal\n- Click team card to open TeamSettings\n- Empty state when no teams exist\n\n---\n\n### 5. Sidebar Navigation Component\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/Sidebar.tsx` (285 lines)\n\nStructure:\n- **Header**: Workspace name (links to `/my-issues`)\n- **Main section**: My Issues, Inbox (with unread badge)\n- **Teams section**: Collapsible teams with nested links:\n  - Issues (`/team/{teamId}/issues`)\n  - Active Cycle (`/team/{teamId}/cycles`)\n  - Projects (`/team/{teamId}/projects`)\n  - Views (`/team/{teamId}/views`)\n- **Workspace section**: All Projects, All Teams, Members, Labels, Settings\n\nKey features:\n- Dynamic team expansion/collapse with state management\n- Active link highlighting based on current pathname\n- Unread notification badge on Inbox\n- Responds to `sidebarCollapsed` state\n\n---\n\n### 6. Netlify Functions (Team Management)\n\n#### `/api/teams` Handler\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/teams.ts` (214 lines)\n\nEndpoints:\n- **GET /api/teams** - List all teams with member count and active cycle name\n- **GET /api/teams/{teamId}** - Get team detail with members and available members\n- **POST /api/teams** - Create new team (validates identifier uniqueness, 2-5 chars, uppercase)\n- **PUT /api/teams/{teamId}** - Update team fields (name, identifier, description)\n- **DELETE /api/teams/{teamId}** - Delete team (cascades: removes team_members, clears issues team_id, deletes cycles, deletes team)\n\n#### `/api/team-members` Handler\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-members.ts` (100 lines)\n\nEndpoints:\n- **POST /api/team-members** - Add member to team\n- **DELETE /api/team-members** - Remove member from team\n\n---\n\n### 7. Members Management\n\n#### Members Page\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Members.tsx` (79 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- List workspace members with roles and team assignments\n- Invite Member button opens InviteMemberModal\n- Role change dropdown (Admin/Member)\n- Remove member confirmation\n- Prevent demoting last admin\n\n#### MemberList Component\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/MemberList.tsx` (108 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- Table layout: Name, Email, Role, Teams, Actions columns\n- Avatar with initials\n- Member-specific actions via MemberActions component\n\n#### MemberActions Component\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/MemberActions.tsx` (151 lines)\n\nFeatures:\n- **Role Dropdown**: Opens on button click, shows Admin/Member options with checkmark for current role\n- Disabled when user is self and last admin\n- Click-outside auto-closes dropdown\n- Confirmation dialog for member removal\n- Loading state during async operations\n\nKey testIds for role dropdown:\n- `member-role-dropdown-btn-{memberId}`\n- `member-role-dropdown-{memberId}`\n- `member-role-option-admin-{memberId}`\n- `member-role-option-member-{memberId}`\n\n---\n\n### 8. State Management\n\n#### TeamsSlice\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamsSlice.ts` (150+ lines)\n\nAsync thunks:\n- `fetchTeams` - Get all teams\n- `fetchTeamDetail` - Get team detail with members\n- `createTeam` - Create new team\n- `updateTeam` - Update team fields\n- `deleteTeam` - Delete team\n- `addTeamMember` - Add member to team\n- `removeTeamMember` - Remove member from team\n\n#### MembersSlice\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/membersSlice.ts` (146 lines)\n\nAsync thunks:\n- `fetchMembers` - Get all workspace members\n- `inviteMember` - Send invite to email\n- `updateMemberRole` - Change member role\n- `removeMember` - Remove member from workspace\n\n---\n\n### 9. Playwright Configuration\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\nConfiguration:\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Timeout: 60 seconds\n- Uses Replay.io for recording\n- Reporters: Replay, JSON, HTML\n- Fully parallel execution, no retries\n\n---\n\n### 10. Shared Pattern - Inline Confirmations (not ConfirmDialog component)\n\n**No separate ConfirmDialog component exists**. Instead, components implement inline confirmation patterns:\n\n1. **TeamSettings.tsx**: Delete team confirmation - inline `showDeleteConfirm` state with conditional render\n2. **MemberActions.tsx**: Remove member confirmation - modal overlay with dialog\n3. **TeamSettings.tsx**: Remove member from team - inline buttons with `removingMemberId` state\n\nThese use local component state rather than a shared dialog component.\n\n---\n\n### 11. Key Test Helpers\n\nFrom test files, common patterns:\n- `loginViaApi()` - Authenticate and get token\n- `getTeams()` - Fetch teams via API\n- `deleteTestTeams()` - Clean up non-seed teams\n- `resetEngTeam()` - Reset to seed values\n- `loginAndNavigateToTeamSettings()` - Full setup for team settings tests\n\n---\n\n### 12. File Structure Summary\n\n```\n/repo/apps/LinearClone/\n├── docs/tests.md                          # Test specifications\n├── playwright.config.ts                   # Playwright configuration\n├── tests/                                 # Playwright tests\n│   ├── team-settings.spec.ts\n│   ├── team-settings-members.spec.ts\n│   ├── teams-*.spec.ts\n│   ├── members-*.spec.ts\n│   └── sidebar-*.spec.ts\n├── src/\n│   ├── pages/\n│   │   ├── Teams.tsx                      # Teams listing page\n│   │   └── Members.tsx                    # Members page\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── TeamSettings.tsx               # Team detail & settings\n│   │   ├── Sidebar.tsx                    # Navigation sidebar\n│   │   ├── MemberList.tsx                 # Members list\n│   │   ├── MemberActions.tsx              # Role dropdown & remove\n│   │   ├── CreateTeamModal.tsx\n│   │   ├── InviteMemberModal.tsx\n│   │   └── ...other components\n│   └── slices/\n│       ├── teamsSlice.ts                  # Teams state & async thunks\n│       └── membersSlice.ts                # Members state & async thunks\n└── netlify/functions/\n    ├── teams.ts                           # GET/POST/PUT/DELETE teams\n    ├── team-members.ts                    # POST/DELETE team members\n    └── ...other functions\n```\n\n---\n\nThis comprehensive analysis covers the team settings page, delete team flow, sidebar navigation, member management with role dropdowns, and all related Netlify functions and tests."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ae5a5837518570bf1 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 73974\ntool_uses: 43\nduration_ms: 62658</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9321a9c-0239-4074-b682-a2d2574835de","uuid":"af7e5a93-42a6-432a-95fb-a72aba7d66a5","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"I need to find the app related to \"linear-clone\" (the current branch is feature/linear-clone). Find:\n1. The app directory under /repo/apps/\n2. The docs/tests.md file for this app\n3. Any existing test files (*.spec.ts)\n4. The team settings related components and pages\n5. The sidebar navigation component\n6. Any Netlify functions related to teams (delete team, update team)\n7. The playwright config\n8. Any shared components like ConfirmDialog\n\nBe thorough - I need to understand the team settings page, delete team flow, and sidebar navigation.","agentId":"ae5a5837518570bf1","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let 