ove member from workspace\n\n---\n\n### 9. Playwright Configuration\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\nConfiguration:\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Timeout: 60 seconds\n- Uses Replay.io for recording\n- Reporters: Replay, JSON, HTML\n- Fully parallel execution, no retries\n\n---\n\n### 10. Shared Pattern - Inline Confirmations (not ConfirmDialog component)\n\n**No separate ConfirmDialog component exists**. Instead, components implement inline confirmation patterns:\n\n1. **TeamSettings.tsx**: Delete team confirmation - inline `showDeleteConfirm` state with conditional render\n2. **MemberActions.tsx**: Remove member confirmation - modal overlay with dialog\n3. **TeamSettings.tsx**: Remove member from team - inline buttons with `removingMemberId` state\n\nThese use local component state rather than a shared dialog component.\n\n---\n\n### 11. Key Test Helpers\n\nFrom test files, common patterns:\n- `loginViaApi()` - Authenticate and get token\n- `getTeams()` - Fetch teams via API\n- `deleteTestTeams()` - Clean up non-seed teams\n- `resetEngTeam()` - Reset to seed values\n- `loginAndNavigateToTeamSettings()` - Full setup for team settings tests\n\n---\n\n### 12. File Structure Summary\n\n```\n/repo/apps/LinearClone/\n├── docs/tests.md                          # Test specifications\n├── playwright.config.ts                   # Playwright configuration\n├── tests/                                 # Playwright tests\n│   ├── team-settings.spec.ts\n│   ├── team-settings-members.spec.ts\n│   ├── teams-*.spec.ts\n│   ├── members-*.spec.ts\n│   └── sidebar-*.spec.ts\n├── src/\n│   ├── pages/\n│   │   ├── Teams.tsx                      # Teams listing page\n│   │   └── Members.tsx                    # Members page\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── TeamSettings.tsx               # Team detail & settings\n│   │   ├── Sidebar.tsx                    # Navigation sidebar\n│   │   ├── MemberList.tsx                 # Members list\n│   │   ├── MemberActions.tsx              # Role dropdown & remove\n│   │   ├── CreateTeamModal.tsx\n│   │   ├── InviteMemberModal.tsx\n│   │   └── ...other components\n│   └── slices/\n│       ├── teamsSlice.ts                  # Teams state & async thunks\n│       └── membersSlice.ts                # Members state & async thunks\n└── netlify/functions/\n    ├── teams.ts                           # GET/POST/PUT/DELETE teams\n    ├── team-members.ts                    # POST/DELETE team members\n    └── ...other functions\n```\n\n---\n\nThis comprehensive analysis covers the team settings page, delete team flow, sidebar navigation, member management with role dropdowns, and all related Netlify functions and tests."}],"totalDurationMs":62658,"totalTokens":73974,"totalToolUseCount":43,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1606,"cache_read_input_tokens":69898,"output_tokens":2466,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1606},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
